CORE
main.c
--function f
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[f\.assertion\.1\] line 3 elements are nondet: FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A --function harness for a pointer-free [static N] parameter initializes the
argument array with one nondet assignment rather than one per element, so
large static sizes do not inflate the harness.
